ame": "mirivyr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199171069598/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 96, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 96, "last_played": 1715077018, "avatar": "0b2febdead253dbeed26c68930af541034d003d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really love this game and have played it on and off since around when it was released. The gameplay is fun, the visuals are beautiful, and over the years so much has been added to the game. \n\nToo much!\n\nThe game (as it is now) is too bloated. There's so much going on that it just feels directionless and overwhelming.\n\nIt's dragged down by the extensive menus, ship functions, armours, customisations etc etc etc that take it far beyond the looter shooter I used to enjoy for casual play. I don't have the dozens of hours it would take to learn everything required to play the game or the inclination to create a new account to go through all the tutorials for everything it now includes.", "timestamp_created": 1715124700, "timestamp_updated": 1715124700, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "164877076", "author": {"steamid": "76561198238840452", "personaname": "K1kz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198238840452/", "num_games_owned": 171, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 40269, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 12, "playtime_at_review": 17565, "last_played": 1789329333, "avatar": "89674599b5d9375b07961c4524718b5b2f432971"}, "language": "english", "review": "the grind never stops", "timestamp_created": 1715123727, "timestamp_updated": 1715123727, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "164876496", "author": {"steamid": "76561198334485432", "personaname": "Rulyns", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imsocoolman/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 32611, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7855, "last_played": 1787331355, "avatar": "f96acdb27f68ed461bd349ee8c2e18a1d21265dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Guys I love this game cause its not grindy at all, its easy to level up, and you basically get all the planets in the first hour. I would recommend this game to anyone who likes an easy going experience and has little to no free time or experience with video games. Starting off, you should probably get the wisp warframe, as she is one of the best starter warframes, you will thank me later!", "timestamp_created": 1715123100, "timestamp_updated": 1715123100, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}]}